with the mini-player gesture were never added to the localization table, so the Appearance screen printed the key itself in every language. They are mapped now (the mobile app ships the wording for the switch and the slider, the description is the desktop one).\n\n### Commits\n- v6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.6: the player carries the mobile lyrics controls\n- v6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.5: every panel expansion animates and follows the animation settings\n- v6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.4: the local history remembers, and the lyrics options are translated\n---\nThis release was built automatically from commit `9bacc8ea4d4e825545d63444e71c332c6b391974`.\n"},{"tag_name":"6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-alpha","name":"Vivi Music 6.0.6.5_DE 1.53.3","published_at":"2026-09-21T17:22:09Z","prerelease":true,"draft":false,"html_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/tag/6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-alpha","assets":[{"name":"innosetup.log","size":49091,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-alpha/innosetup.log"},{"name":"INSTALL-GUIDE.md","size":10167,"download_count":1,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-alpha/INSTALL-GUIDE.md"},{"name":"VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-arm64.dmg","size":153253592,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-alpha/VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-arm64.dmg"},{"name":"VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-arm64.pkg","size":148042628,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-alpha/VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-arm64.pkg"},{"name":"VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-AUR.tar.gz","size":1528,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-alpha/VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-AUR.tar.gz"},{"name":"VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3-setup.exe","size":130749829,"download_count":6